 WP&#39;,Tahoma,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13.3333px\"><span style=\"color:rgb(33,33,33);font-family:wf_segoe-ui_normal,&#39;Segoe UI&#39;,&#39;Segoe WP&#39;,Tahoma,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13.3333px\">The registration deadline is February 22.</span><br style=\"color:rgb(33,33,33);font-family:wf_segoe-ui_normal,&#39;Segoe UI&#39;,&#39;Segoe WP&#39;,Tahoma,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13.3333px\"><br style=\"color:rgb(33,33,33);font-family:wf_segoe-ui_normal,&#39;Segoe UI&#39;,&#39;Segoe WP&#39;,Tahoma,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13.3333px\"><div>- Meena</div></div>"
